# 📄 Requirements Document: Stuffed Animal Detection System

**Project Name:** Animal Audio Alert System  
**Platform:** Raspberry Pi + IMX462 Camera + USB Speaker  
**Goal:** Detect bears and raccoons using a YOLOv5 model and respond with corresponding audio while logging the event.

---
## ✅ Functional Requirements (FR)

- **FR1**: The system shall capture real-time video frames using the connected IMX462 camera.
